{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54184","headline":"水仙花（题拟） 二 · 来鹏","name":"水仙花（题拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花盟平日不曾寒，六月曝根高处安。\n待得秋残亲手种，万姬围绕雪中看。\n（见《全芳备祖前集》卷二一「水仙花」门）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"来鹏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}